  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be helpful to automatically detect a user has not moved or been in their headset after a long period of time, especially with the rising popularity of idle games in VRChat.\n\nAlternatively, or in parity with the above, if we could get an \"invisible\" status, it would help differentiate when we are online and want to be seen as such. As there is already a thread for that feature, I'm omitting it here from the title.\n\nBoth would help with privacy and avoid people having to set status messages or friends joining lobbies and trying to locate a friend only to later discover they were deep in the world AFK, to their frustration.",
